    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyana kaIsarela, tiyenu izu dakuyizuwila danahoshiyi Yehova, dakuhosha nakuzuwila chisaka chejima chinafumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Hayisaka yahamaseki yejima nelukuhu enu hohu; dichi chinakayibabeshelaŋa nakuluwa kwenu kwejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ayedi endi hamu chakadi kutiyaloŋana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutuŋa abulumi mwisaŋa chakadi yanakwatiyi? Mwenzi wamutupa ahoshi muchididi chindi chakadi yanakwatiyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kajila afwi mumuhetu hamaseki chakadi kumuta? Muhetu wusahuki heseki chakadi chuma chinafumu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpuŋa yivumi mumukala antu kutiya woma nehi? Chuma chatama chiwani mukala chakadi Yehova kuchikoŋa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala Mwanta Yehova hakela chuma chakadi kumwekeshela ambuŋindi atuprofwetu chuma chindi chanajindiyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutuŋa nabulumi wukubula kutiya woma hinyi? Mwanta Yehova nahoshi wukuleka kuprofweta hinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bidikishenu mumatala amuAshidodi awanta, nimumatala amwituŋa daEjipitu awanta, nenu, Dipompeshenu hamapidi amuSamariya mutali masoyoyu asweja aduku, nimakabisha aduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Aswekaŋa nindombu nikubuwa mumatalawu awanta, hiyeluka kwila mwaloŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nahoshi nindi, Kwituŋa kwakanyeŋumuka mukwankunyi hohu; wakakusandila Ŋovu jeyi, nimataleyi awanta akayipupa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Anyana kaIsarela ashakama kunsa yakadidi, hela hanyisawu yakukadidi yaswara, akayihukula chakuhukula neyi chahukulaŋayi kabiŋa tunyendu tuyedi, hela kachibalu ketelu mukanwa kamutupa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova, Nzambi yamazaza, nindi, Tiyenu, muyishimwini akwamutaŋa waYakoba wunsahu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenu, Mwifuku dinakababesha aIsarela nanyiloŋa yawu, nakababesha nawa nitumeŋa twakuBeteli, nseŋu jakukameŋa jakaketukaku, jakaholoka hamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naketela kumu niitala dahachishika niitala dahankanza; matala ambiŋa yanjamba akakisika,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
